      <activity id="af0073f9-3e88-563a-a5ab-392a1ea14fa4" activityNameId="e30fa8b7-c4b1-5cc3-add0-5f95c70728f1" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">xxx Operation, high speed train</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xxx Operation, high speed train
Energy data from an extensive study of a German ICE track. Particulate emissions due to abrasion of rail tracks, wheels, brakes and overhead contact line is included. Emission of sulphur hexafluoride (SF6) occurring during conversion at traction substations are accounted for.;
UUID: e5982598-c5da-3be6-9667-f015a4e152bf
The inventory includes the actual energy consumption due to traction and operations on board.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Mix of ICE I (40%) and ICE 2 (60%)
Time period: Nicht spezifiziert
Production volume: na
Sampling: literature studies and own assumptions 
Extrapolations: see Technology and Geography
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_e5982598-c5da-3be6-9667-f015a4e152bf.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
